  "body": "Title and CCC issued! Move in ready.\r\n\r\nImagine your children walking to some of East Auckland's most sought-after schools, while you come home each day to a beautiful brand-new home designed for family life.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 1/19 Maugham Drive, Bucklands Beach - where premium quality, an elevated position and an exceptional family location come together.\r\n\r\nSet proudly on an elevated site, the home enjoys an open outlook with a wonderful sense of space and privacy.\r\n\r\nInside, there is room for everyone. Five bedrooms, three bathrooms and two generous living areas provide the flexibility a growing or extended family needs. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, while the second living area offers extra space to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed and beautifully finished, this brand-new home features a stylish modern kitchen, quality contemporary interiors and EV charging in the garage, delivering the comfort and convenience expected from a premium new build.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location.\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance of sought-after local schools, including BBI and Macleans College, and close to Bucklands Beach, Eastern Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services and local amenities, this is a location where families can put down roots and enjoy the Eastern Bays lifestyle.\r\n\r\nYour children can walk to school. Your family can grow here and you can come home to a place you're proud to call your own.\r\n\r\nPremium Quality. Elevated Outlook. Prime School Zone. Exceptional Family Living.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to make 1/19 Maugham Drive, Bucklands Beach your family's next chapter.\r\n\r\nContact Harley Hou - 021 278 0830 or Marilyn Hong Ma - 021 047 4498 today to arrange your viewing or find out more.\r\n\r\nConjunctions are warmly welcomed.",
